thanks to Noah, and

00:35:14.160 --> 00:35:16.769
Dawn and Dan's analysis

00:35:16.950 --> 00:35:19.199
of Karski's various testimonies.

00:35:21.000 --> 00:35:22.127
Larry's analysis of the

00:35:22.290 --> 00:35:23.858
Americanization of the Holocaust

00:35:23.900 --> 00:35:25.019
through film, especially through the

00:35:25.020 --> 00:35:26.020
film, which I love, Inglorious

00:35:26.820 --> 00:35:28.679
Basterds, but I now understand

00:35:28.680 --> 00:35:30.449
why I like it better, thanks to

00:35:31.380 --> 00:35:32.939
Larry's article. And for me also, I

00:35:32.940 --> 00:35:34.704
